  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study horticultural seedling business opportunities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this study is to identify high-potential locations for establishing commercial vegetable and potato seedling nurseries in Northern and Southwestern Nigeria, and to develop a strategic roadmap that supports Dutch companies, individually or through public-private partnerships, in creating sustainable and viable seedling production ventures.The outcome will:&#x2022;	Identify and justify two high-potential locations for establishing commercial vegetable seedling nurseries and potato seedling nurseries in the North of Nigeria; &#x2022;	Identify and justify two high-potential locations for establishing commercial vegetable seedling nurseries in the Southwest of Nigeria; &#x2022;	Provide a roadmap for developing viable business models for Dutch companies (individually or through PPPs) to establish sustainable seedling production ventures.</narrative>
  </description>
